All of them.

133
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,600
I need specifics.

134
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,160
All of them.

135
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,320
Specifics.

136
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,760
All of them.

137
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,920
Specifics.

138
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:22,580
All of them.

139
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,260
All of them.

140
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,680
All of them.

141
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,620
All of them.

142
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,520
All.

143
